# Effect RPC + streams

- API is `@effect/rpc` only (not tRPC, oRPC, REST, Socket.IO).
- Transports: `RpcServer.layerProtocolHttp` and `layerProtocolWebsocket` only.
- Client payload always has `afterSeq: Schema.optionalKey(Schema.Number)`.
- Client stores last `seq` from the stream and sends it on reconnect.

## Producer
Persist to `stream_events` → then publish. Never publish first.

## Consumer
Subscribe live (wait until subscribed) → replay `seq > afterSeq` → concat live filtered `seq > max(replayed)`.

Implementation (T8): `apps/server/src/features/durable-stream/DurableStream.ts`.
Read `.cursor/skills/effect-rpc-streams/SKILL.md`.
